  "description": "Audio encoding/decoding toolkit for .NET — 12 formats (AAC, AIFF/AIFC, ALAC, AU, FLAC, MP3, Opus, TTA, Vorbis, WAV incl. IMA/MS/Yamaha ADPCM and G.711, WavPack, WMA) plus MOV/MP4 probing, entirely pure C# (no native dependency of any kind), built-in waveform/peak/RMS generation, WAV metadata tag reading, and an opt-in PCM transform pipeline (resampling, gain/peak normalization, dynamics compression, noise gating, peak limiting, echo/delay, pan/balance, channel remix, fades, parametric EQ, FIR filtering, mixing), fully in-process behind one IMediaEncoder interface. No ffmpeg, no subprocess, no platform restriction. Built for high-throughput music distribution pipelines.",
